{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國男神邊佑錫向來形象健康，深得各大國際品牌喜愛。</p><p>早前，他便為代言意大利高級珠寶品牌拍攝宣傳照，展示貴氣又時尚的一面。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;此外，邊佑錫即將再來香港，本周日舉行假亞洲博覽館Hall 10號舉行亞洲巡迴粉</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T15:24:06.311851+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T15:03:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T15:17:18.516613+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T15:17:18.516613+00:00","content_hash":"4c345375aaea5f151d41c6f09711a846926e1e9ce47a5dfa84d54d484c0eb014","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}